格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"CodeGraph navigation tools for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1350799424","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tool-codegraph","slug":"m1khal3v/dsh-tool-codegraph","topics":["ai-tools","deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","deepseek-harness-plugins","deepseek-harness-tool","deepseek-harness-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"CodeGraph navigation tools for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"dsh-tool-codegraph"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"CodeGraph navigation tools for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DSH plugin that wraps the open-source codegraph CLI\n(an AST/tree-sitter code index) into ten focus"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ed agent tools — status, search,\ncallers/callees, impact, explore, and more."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **This package is a thin wrapper.** All indexing and querying is done by the\n> codegraph CLI — ins"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"tall it first\n> and make sure its binary is on `PATH`."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ⚡️ Highlights"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- 🧭 **Orientation-first workflow** — usage rules (`status → sync → explore → targeted lookups`) are "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"injected into the agent system prompt automatically.\n- 🧰 **Ten focused tools**, one per operation — "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"no mega-tool with an `action` parameter.\n- ⚡ **O(1) indexed lookups** — light outputs for the main s"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ession, heavy explore builds routed to subagents.\n- ⚠️ **Honest about soundness** — callers/callees/"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"impact can miss dynamic-dispatch edges; the prompt tells the model when to fall back to `grep`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🛠 Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `>=0.2.1-rc.5 <0.3.0`\n- Node `^22.19 || >=24`\n- The `codegraph` CLI available on "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"`PATH` (override via the `executable` config key)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 1. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 2. Check the wrapped CLI"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"If the binary is missing, the tools reply with an install hint and the agent\nfalls back to `grep`-ba"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ry is missing, the tools reply with an install hint and the agent\nfalls back to `grep`-based search."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 3. Initialize the index — your call"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"There is deliberately **no init tool** in the set above: following the codegraph\nproject's own recom"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"mendation, indexing should be kicked off by the user, not by\nan agent. When `codegraph status` repor"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ts a missing index, run it yourself:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Until you do, the tools report the missing index and the agent keeps working\nwith other search tools"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ntil you do, the tools report the missing index and the agent keeps working\nwith other search tools."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 🖥 Desktop"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This plugin works in DSH Desktop as well as the CLI:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Install it through the app's **Plugins** page.\n- The `codegraph` CLI must be available on `PATH` o"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"f the desktop host process.\n- All ten tools work in desktop sessions; no separate client half is nee"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"e desktop host process.\n- All ten tools work in desktop sessions; no separate client half is needed."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🧰 Tools"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose | Output |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `codegraph_status` | Index health and statistics | light |\n| `codegraph_sync` | Sync changes since"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" the last index | long |\n| `codegraph_search` | Find a symbol by name | light |\n| `codegraph_explore"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"` | Map an area with verbatim source and call paths | heavy |\n| `codegraph_callers` | Who calls this"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" symbol (unsound) | light |\n| `codegraph_callees` | What this symbol calls | light |\n| `codegraph_im"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"pact` | Blast radius of changing a symbol | light |\n| `codegraph_node` | One symbol's details or a f"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"ile view | light |\n| `codegraph_files` | Project file structure from the index | light |\n| `codegrap"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"h_affected` | Find test files affected by changed source files | light |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Key | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| `executable` | `codegraph` | Binary name or path of the wrapped CLI |\n| `queryTimeoutMs` | `10000`"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" | Timeout for regular commands |\n| `initTimeoutMs` | `60000` | Timeout for `init` / `sync` |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🧑‍💻 Development"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Built on top of colbymchenry/codegraph."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
